# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  ALLOW-LIST .gitignore
#  This repository lives inside a working folder that also holds a Chrome
#  profile, rendered output and local scratch. Rather than blacklisting those
#  one by one, everything is ignored by default and only the files listed
#  below are ever tracked. Nothing can leak by accident.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!nyta_creative_engine.html
!NYTA.bat
!push.bat
!install_shortcut.ps1
!nyta.ico
!docs/
!docs/*.png
